      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Black Out Night (BON) returns alongside French Theatre's presentation of Neige sur Abidjan, inviting audiences to experience an evening that celebrates culture, conversation, and community.  The evening begins with BON Chat, a special pre-show conversation..."
      }
