    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In this touching and intimate work of autofiction, Iannicko N’Doua takes us on a coming-of-age journey across years and continents, guided by a griot with a thousand faces, played by the charismatic Hamadoun Kassogué. Initially,..."
