    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Pacific Theatre Production Forgive him Father for he has chosen theatre. Ins Choi, the creator of Kim’s Convenience, comes from a long line of clergy. Before he was born, his mother made an offering to..."
